{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1063618/block/singleImage/3266333/df/1599952792_wB.JPG?updatedAt=1794538301\"/><figcaption>基督教聯合醫院</figcaption></figure><p>周四(12日)傍晚6時05分，牛池灣彩輝邨彩葉樓一單位，25歲姓吳女子被家人發現企圖自殺。救援人員接報到場，發現吳女倒臥床上，其頭部被膠袋包裹，膠袋連接一罐氮氣，她昏迷被送往基督教聯合醫院救治。警方於現場有檢獲遺書，據悉她近日收工作問題所困，案件被列作企圖自殺跟進。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T03:35:01.014309+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T02:51:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T14:56:29.620927+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T03:28:24.374736+00:00","content_hash":"f9ba33b3bc23c6814307c7efedf85991c802c4af48462350ce35205456cf479b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T03:35:01.014309+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}